  <data name="WelcomeText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Welcome to Quill.

Write here, then save the note as a .qnote file. Open and Import read notes back, Export all copies every note to a folder.

Remind me shows a Windows notification later: type a line into it to add it to the note, or snooze it. It works even after Quill is closed.

In Settings, let Windows open .qnote files and quill:// links with Quill, or pick another language. Quill runs once: a second start hands its file or link to this window.</value></data>
